raph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プロとしての斉藤優里は駄目でしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の人間としての斉藤優里は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かい言葉に涙が堪え切れません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まいまいとちーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん気遣ってくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日かけつけてくれた皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂46のことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして斉藤優里はもっと成長して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきたいと思った日になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/07/7253130/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"t